{"about":["Experience Twisted Metal™ 3 originally released on the PlayStation® console, enhanced with up-rendering, rewind, quick save, and custom video filters. Welcome to our twisted world where the drivers are insane, the explosions apocalyptic and the weapons hard-core nasty. It’s the original and ultimate automotive combat experience! Get twisted with high powered vehicles, an arsenal of weapons and unbeatable bosses! This title has been converted from the PlayStation® version to the PlayStation®4 and PlayStation®5 consoles and provides newly added features. Consequently, there may be times where the title plays differently from the PlayStation® version, or where some features may cause the title to not function properly. This version does not support the PlayStation® console’s peripherals, therefore some functionality may not be available."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/0a48fd7a56502d6146251dab6f86f9ff371201338ac09de9.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/0a48fd7a56502d6146251dab6f86f9ff371201338ac09de9.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/21f741d7eee287bef56a8e07f38a12d399db57061c9581d6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/21f741d7eee287bef56a8e07f38a12d399db57061c9581d6.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/a17d0e6659c450780489b2aac0f563c91c2ceb777c97191a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/a17d0e6659c450780489b2aac0f563c91c2ceb777c97191a.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/198ccad08ade7f5bd384bcb2127cad4d2ee41e3504e4e8c5.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202507/1018/198ccad08ade7f5bd384bcb2127cad4d2ee41e3504e4e8c5.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"}